# Jagex account credentials for the development client.
#
#   copy this file to  jx.env  and fill in the values
#
# jx.env is gitignored on purpose. These are LIVE SESSION TOKENS for your
# account - do not commit them, paste them into chat, or share them.
#
# Where the values come from:
#   The Jagex Launcher injects these into the environment of the RuneLite
#   process it starts. The dev client is launched by Gradle instead, so it never
#   sees them unless you copy them across.
#
#   1. Launch RuneLite normally from the Jagex Launcher.
#   2. Read that process's environment block. Sysinternals Process Explorer is
#      the usual tool: find the RuneLite java process, right-click ->
#      Properties -> Environment tab.
#   3. Copy the JX_ values below.
#
# They expire. When the dev client stops being able to log in, repeat the steps
# above with a freshly launched RuneLite.
#
# Not every variable is always present - blank lines are skipped, so leave any
# you don't see empty.

JX_ACCESS_TOKEN=
JX_REFRESH_TOKEN=
JX_SESSION_ID=
JX_CHARACTER_ID=
JX_DISPLAY_NAME=
